# Converting a thing to JSON goes through an ordered hashtable, whose keys
# ignore case: names that differ only in case become one entry, where the
# first was, with the last one's name and value.
p has name "a"
set "Name" to "b" in p
set "NAME" to "c" in p
say p
convert p to json into j
say j
q has x 1
set "y" to 2 in q
set "X" to 3 in q
inner has Id 1
set "id" to 2 in inner
set "inner" to inner in q
items are
    q
    inner
.
convert items to json into k
say k
